          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery Options",
            "content": "<p>Shipping and Delivery days for all methods of shipping are Monday – Friday, excluding federal holidays. If your order is completed before 3pm (ET) it will be shipped the same day. Orders placed after 3pm (ET) will ship the next shipping day.</p><p>Standard Delivery: Shipped within the continental US via standard home delivery service. You can expect your package 5-7 shipping days after it is shipped.</p><p>Express: Most JanSport orders within the continental US ship via 3-Day service. You can expect your package three full days after the day it ships.</p><p>Overnight: Shipped within the continental US, you can expect your package one full day after it ships.</p>"
          }
